title Vinyl started by hand (no launcher contract): it runs on its own probe
sizes 480x320
# a 480x320 panel's own density (6.08 px/mm): without it the probe takes the deck's 11.3, a 42 mm wide 480x320
# screen no board has, whose 80 px target leaves no room for the transport keys and the seek row apart
ppmm 608
nocontract
env VINYL_DEMO 1

wait 800
shot nocontract
expect noquit
